## 🛠️ 3. Tech Stack & Architecture

### Core Technologies
* **Framework & XR Engine:** Meta Immersive Web SDK (`@iwsdk/core`) + Three.js (WebGL2 / WebXR Device API)
* **Language & Build Tooling:** TypeScript (ES Modules), Vite (`virtual:iwsdk-project`)
* **Voice & Natural Language Understanding:** Meta **Wit.ai HTTP API** (`GET https://api.wit.ai/message`) + Web Speech API (`SpeechRecognition` & `SpeechSynthesis`) + Hybrid deterministic NLU fallback for zero-latency offline reliability
* **Audio Synthesis:** Procedural Web Audio API (`AudioContext` sine-wave harmonic chimes)
* **State & Persistence:** Reactive singleton store (`LumaStateStore`) backed by browser `localStorage` (`lumadesk_clinical_store_v5`) with automatic daily streak rollover

### Repository Architecture
```text
lumadesk/
├── index.html                        # Entry HTML container (#scene-container)
├── package.json                      # Dependencies (@iwsdk/core, TypeScript, Vite)
└── src/
    ├── index.ts                      # World.create() bootstrap & LumaDeskSystem registration
    ├── lumadesk.ts                   # Main ECS System: 3-table cockpit, colinear XR raycaster,
    │                                 #   3D Kanban board, Visual Focus Timer, MR Passthrough,
    │                                 #   Plasma Voice Orb, Sky Birds & Garden interactions
    ├── state/
