    │   ├── sandbox-builder.ts        # Isolated 3D Visuomotor Tracing Canvas, Xylophone & Sky Shop
    │   └── wit-voice.ts              # Meta Wit.ai NLU client, SpeechRecognition & demo cycling
    ├── worlds/
    │   └── world-generator.ts        # Procedural 360° sky domes (Forest, Ocean, Dino, Space) & Evening Dim
    └── ui/
        └── dev-inspector.ts          # Accessible Kid Bar HUD, Parent/Wit.ai Config & Therapist Report Modal

Technical Highlight: 100% Colinear WebXR Raycasting
To prevent cursor-to-laser drift for neurodivergent users, LumaDesk parents unit-length (1.0m) -Z laser beams directly to world.input.xr.xrOrigin.raySpaces.left and raySpaces.right. Each frame, findHitTarget() dynamically scales beam.scale.z = d and locks tip.position.z = -d along the exact hit distance d (with a 2.6cm closest-point-on-ray projection for curved 3D meshes), ensuring the golden target dot is welded to the tip of the white ray line with zero parallax offset.

🚀 4. Getting Started (Installation & Setup)
Prerequisites
Node.js v18.0.0 or higher (npm included)

A modern browser with WebXR support (Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, or Meta Quest Browser)

(Optional) Meta Quest 2 / Quest Pro / Quest 3 / Quest 3S headset, or the Immersive Web Emulator (IWE) Chrome extension for desktop XR hand-tracking simulation

Step-by-Step Local Setup

1. Clone the Respository: 

Bash git clone [https://github.com/](https://github.com/)<your-username>/lumadesk.git
cd lumadesk

Install dependencies: Bash npm install

Start the local Development server: 

Bash npm run dev "Vite will start the local server (typically at http://localhost:8081 or http://localhost:5173). Open the displayed URL in your browser."

Configure Meta Wit.ai Token(Optional):
*Click 👨‍👩‍👧 Parent & Judge Menu ▾ on the bottom HUD bar, then click 👨‍👩‍👧 Parent & Wit.ai Setup.

*Paste your Meta Wit.ai Client/Server Bearer Token (or leave it blank to use the built-in Hybrid NLU & instant judge demo utterances).

Productiob Build: Bash npm run build | npm run preview

🧭 5. Judge Walkthrough & Quick-Start Guide
We designed LumaDesk so a judge can experience 100% of the core productivity and clinical features in under 2 minutes—either in a Meta Quest headset or directly in a desktop browser.

Step 1: Onboard or Use Quick Demo Login (10 sec)
On launch, click ⚡ Quick Demo Login (or customize the child's nickname, birthday, and therapy focus) in the Parent Sign-Up modal.

Step 2: Test the Left-Wing 3D Kanban Board & Visual Focus Timer (30 sec)
Look at the Left Purple Table: you will see three glowing columns (🔴 TO-DO, 🟡 DOING, 🟢 DONE) and 4 Daily Routine Context pills (☀️ Morning, 🚌 Commute, 📚 Study, 🌙 Night).

Click/pinch any card in 🔴 TO-DO (e.g., 📌 Pack drawing pad) ➔ It moves to 🟡 DOING and automatically starts the 2-Minute 3D Visual Focus Timer Ring around the center desk rim!

Click/pinch the card in 🟡 DOING ➔ It moves to 🟢 DONE, awarding +15✨ Sparks and +1🌱 Seed.

Click Luma (the glowing blue pet in the center) anytime to trigger the "🎲 Pick 1 Tiny Step For Me!" decision unblocker.

Step 3: Trigger Meta Wit.ai Voice NLU & 3D Weather Hologram (25 sec)
Tap the Cyan-Magenta Liquid-Plasma Orb on the right (🎙️ Speak to Luma (Wit.ai)) or press V on your keyboard.

Speak into your microphone (or let the built-in Judge Demo cycler fire sample utterances automatically):

"What is the weather and what should I wear?" ➔ Spawns the 3D Weather & Sensory Outfit Hologram.

"Break down my homework" ➔ Splits the task into 3 micro-steps across 🔴 TO-DO and 🟡 DOING.

"Remind me to pack my math book" ➔ Pins a new 3D card onto the Left Kanban Board.

Step 4: Experience the Isolated 3D Visuomotor Tracing Canvas (25 sec)
Click 🎨 3D Brush & Xylophone on the bottom bar, then click 🖌️ Open 3D Drawing Canvas (or tap any of the 4 neon paint pots).

Notice how all background tables and UI vanish to prevent sensory overload.

Hold down click/pinch and drag along the semi-transparent Lazy-8 Infinity Loop to connect all 5 glowing star checkpoints (+20✨ Sparks).

Click ✨ Change Trace Guide to cycle through INFINITY, WAVE, STAR, and FREE draw modes, then click ❌ Close Canvas to cleanly restore the 3-table room.

Step 5: Plant & Water the Right-Wing Botanical Garden + Switch to MR View (20 sec)
Tap 💧 Water or 🍎 Safe Meal on the center desk to log biological self-care.

Look at the Right Green Table: tap 🌱 Pick Seed and touch any empty pot, then tap 🚿 Grab Watering Can and sweep across the pots to grow a blooming 3D tree!

Finally, tap the 3D Mini House Icon (🏠 Real Room (MR)) on the left (or press P) to see the center table hollow out into a clean Mixed Reality Homework Cockpit.

Open 👨‍👩‍👧 Parent & Judge Menu ▾ ➔ 📊 Daily Report to inspect and copy the clinical telemetry summary.

